            "english_quote": "the leaders among your Egyptians",
            "issue": "The main rendering defensibly attaches ὑμῶν to the Egyptians, but an important alternative attaches it to ἀρχηγέται: “your leaders from among the Egyptians.” This changes whose leaders they are. The existing note discusses the meaning of ἀρχηγέται without disclosing this attachment uncertainty. This is a disclosure problem, not source corruption or an indefensible main rendering.",
